# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

~> An environment must always have a default language.  Setting `default = false` on a non-English default language resets the default to `en`.  To unset `default` on `en` itself, first set `default = true` on another language.  Keep resource addresses stable when switching defaults; moving a language between resources can cause conflicting updates during creation and destruction.

~> Destroying a `pingone_language_update` resource that manages `en` while it is the environment default removes the resource from Terraform state only; the language remains enabled and set as the default in PingOne.

